  "comment": "Ovation H-605FC takes full advantage of LED technology, utilizing the Ovation standard RGBA-Lime color palette to enable the fixture to replicate nearly any color with tremendous color rendering, as well as nearly any color temperature of white. Superior convection cooling provides excellent output in a compact package. Ideal for theatrical and house of worship applications, setup and control is now easier than ever with the addition of W-DMX, RDM, adjustable PWM and an easy to navigate OLED full text display.",
